New default palette: a white page, a dark gray secondary (`#343a40`: footer, header bar, gray bands) and a dark blue accent (`#0f4c81`, `#1b4d82` in dark mode) replacing black and orange, with light text on the dark surfaces in both color modes. Every text and accent color meets WCAG AA contrast on its background. Links follow the primary Color Group's accent color, so they stay readable in dark mode. Sites that never set their own colors show the new palette. @Humanaice
